a barbed sluice-hook~
A barbed iron sluice-hook has been abandoned beside the channel.~
The long iron tool ends in a heavy hooked point once used to clear
debris from drainage grates. Its haft has been wrapped for use as an
improvised weapon, and old impact marks show that someone tested it on
more than refuse.
~
