Slaive's concealed iron safe~
A concealed iron safe is set into the refuge wall.~
The squat safe is built directly into a cut recess in the stone. False
masonry and a hinged panel once hid it from casual inspection. The
lock has long since failed, but scratches around the frame suggest
Slaive opened it often.
~
