#3802
nightneedle slaive knife dagger backstabber~
Nightneedle, Slaive's last knife~
Nightneedle rests here, its narrow edge drinking the available light.~
Slaive's favored knife is long, narrow, and almost completely
blackened by age and use. The balance is excellent, the point brutally
fine, and the wrapped grip has been shaped by years in the same hand.
A tiny silver line along the spine is the only ornament.
~
